# Allowlist for the whisper-server build context (the repository root).
#
# The first non-comment line is '*': everything in the context is denied unless
# a later '!' line allows it. A '!' line for a directory re-includes everything
# beneath it, so no ancestor lines are written; each line below names exactly
# what a COPY needs. The whisper-server recipe COPYs the installDist tree
# server/modules/whisper-server/build/install/whisper-server/, so that tree is
# the only path re-included here.
*
!server/modules/whisper-server/build/install/whisper-server/**
